1794730482.578892 execve("/usr/bin/python3", ["python3", "-c", "import pathlib,sys\nr,m=sys.argv[1],sys.argv[2]\nprint('review',len(r),'message',len(m))\nassert len(r)<=4000 and len(m)<=1200 and r.endswith('\\n') and m.endswith('\\n')\np=pathlib.Path('/output'); p.mkdir(exist_ok=True)\n(p/'review.md').write_text(r); (p/'message.md').write_text(m)\nprint('ok')\n", "# GuardianAI release review\n\nReviewer only. Read incoming build-report.json, manifest.json, handoff.md, and handoff-receipt.json. Compared manifest hashes to public source. Did not modify source. Did not fetch the archive, recompile, or run native/notify-launch --abi.\n\n## Checks that passed\n\nHandoff-receipt.json files_sha256 matches the delivered bytes:\n- build-report.json 0d615578a15cf85a16cfc50d60150c6e50b2fa251b378b216a01ca6fe45461ad (216 bytes)\n- manifest.json d082456bfe1342cab51bfb2ffd33cbf7c885cd5605bea9d6b7d2bc9b2e7a05e2 (1723 bytes)\n- handoff.md c1f52372023446cbc397805a54387acb6d0e2c0c9cdacdb56e1f7d5b108c4d3d (799 bytes)\n\nbuild-report.json matches the handoff figures: GuardianAI-linux-x86_64.zip, sha256 7a3005fcb3e36f2e627ca66808b733f9b2cd542d7895fdf3f49edf0615aac9d6, 40092 bytes, native_policy 3, launch_guard_version 1, file_count 15.\n\nmanifest.json files_sha256 has 14 names. SHA-256 matched the public tree for all 12 present files: agent_observer.py, build_release.py, guarded_agent.py, guarded_sessi"..., "# To the builder\n\nReceipt hashes for build-report.json, manifest.json, and handoff.md match.\n\nFrom build_release.py, files_sha256 is filled before manifest.json is written. The 14 names are 12 copied sources (including agent_observer.py) plus RUNNING.txt and native/notify-launch. file_count adds 1 for manifest.json, so 15 matches that code. native_policy 3 and launch_guard_version 1 match notify_launch.c, the build ABI gate, seccomp_gate.py, and the manifest. Twelve public-source hashes match. CODING_AGENT.md and PROJECT_DIRECTION.md sit outside the map, which fits the core-runtime scope.\n\nUnverified: archive sha256 7a3005fc... and size 40092, zip membership of agent_observer.py, native/notify-launch 91491b52..., and RUNNING.txt 0571b170.... The zip and those two files were not in the handoff. Eval of the RUNNING.txt literal failed with SyntaxError; it was not retried.\n\nPlease attach the archive (or zip member names plus the raw digest) and the notify-launch and RUNNING.txt bytes. In handoff.md, state that fi"...], 0x7ffe02bf4170 /* 3 vars */) = 0
